WIKIPEDIA / CBURNETT CHESS PIECES
=================================

The twelve piece images in this directory (wK.png ... bP.png, rendered at
192x192 with transparent backgrounds) are of the chess pieces drawn by
Colin M. Burnett ("Cburnett" on Wikipedia), the set Wikipedia, lichess and
most chess programs show by default.

  Author:  Colin M. Burnett
  Source:  the original SVGs as kept by lichess in
           https://github.com/lichess-org/lila (public/piece/cburnett/)
  License: GNU General Public License, version 2 or later (GPLv2+)

They are rendered here unmodified in shape (only scaled to PNG). The pieces
are used under the terms of the GPL; the SVG sources and the license text
are available from the addresses above.

To use a different set, replace the twelve PNGs with same-named files
(wK.png, wQ.png, wR.png, wB.png, wN.png, wP.png and the b* ones), or point
the PIECES environment variable at a directory holding them. With no
complete set to be found the program draws its own pieces instead and these
files are never touched.
